expect: stays
bars: carried by
why: the skip message names the platform and leaves the reason unsaid, so it carries half the fact; run 10's lane deleted a reason of this shape as carried by the skip, and the reader of the check can no longer tell why the platform is skipped
labelled: 2026-09-24
--- context
The change set touches tests/helpers/ExportHelper.ts. The block below was in the file before the change.
--- code
export function assertDataUriPlatform(): void {
  // The export stub loads its fixture from a data URI, and the legacy ledger UI refuses a data URI in a posting request.
  if (isLegacyLedgerUi()) {
    throw new SkipException('Legacy ledger UI');
  }
}
